  "Inflation-Hedging Strategies": "インフレに負けない実践的防衛策",
  "Hold Equities": "実物資産と株式の保有",
  "High-quality businesses can raise product prices to keep pace with inflation, making diversified stock portfolios the premier long-term inflation hedge.": "優れた企業はコスト上昇を製品価格に転嫁できるため、優良企業の株式保有は最も効果的なインフレヘッジとなります。",
  "Treasury Inflation-Protected Securities (TIPS)": "物価連動国債などの活用",
  "TIPS adjust their principal value upward with changes in the CPI, ensuring your principal keeps pace with official inflation.": "物価上昇率に応じて元本が調整される債券は、インフレによる実質資産の目減りを防ぎます。",
  "Real Estate & Tangible Assets": "不動産・インフラ資産の組み入れ",
  "Property values and rental incomes historically rise during inflationary periods while fixed mortgage payments stay constant.": "不動産の賃料や物件価値はインフレに伴って上昇する傾向があり、固定金利ローンの実質負債は縮小します。",
  // === paycheck ===
  "Demystifying Your Paycheck: Gross vs. Net Pay": "給与明細の見方：額面給与から手取り額まで",
