  "A difference of just 1% in annual investment fees can wipe out hundreds of thousands of dollars over a 30-year investing career due to the loss of compounding returns on those deducted fees.": "わずか年1%の手数料の差が、30年以上の複利運用で数百万円以上の資産の差となって現れます。",
