  // === crypto-dca ===
  "Mastering Dollar-Cost Averaging (DCA) in Volatile Markets": "仮想通貨（暗号資産）の積立投資（DCA戦略）",
  "Dollar-Cost Averaging is an investment discipline where you invest fixed cash sums at regular calendar intervals, eliminating the emotional pitfalls of market timing.": "価格変動が極めて激しい市場において、定期的に一定額を購入し続けることで購入単価を平準化する手法です。",
